= Win Over the Senate Guard

The Senate Guard swore an oath to the Senate before they ever swore one to the Chancellor's office.

- @do: Win Over the Senate Guard.
- @easy_discard

@do
on-arrival: guard_turned = 1; capital -= 1

Several Guard commanders, veterans of the old blue-robed Senate Guard, quietly let the Caucus know they will not fire on senators.
